-label="udp${NP_SYSTEM:+ $NP_SYSTEM}${NP_TWO:+ (two games)}${NP_NEO_RAN:+ (host played first: core reload)}${NP_OSD:+ (OSD mode${NP_OSD_STEPS:+, stepping})}${NP_SERVER_BIN:+ (server${NP_MENU:+, room from the menu}${NP_INCORE:+, Join room in the core}${NP_DECOY:+, two rooms}${NP_AUTOJOIN:+, Join same game}${NP_DIRECT:+, direct=$NP_DIRECT}${NP_SAV:+, .sav})}${NP_GBA_RELOAD:+ ($NP_GBA_RELOAD loads the game again)}"
+label="udp${NP_SYSTEM:+ $NP_SYSTEM}${NP_TWO:+ (two games)}${NP_NEO_RAN:+ (host played first: core reload)}${NP_NEO_SPLIT_JOIN:+ (the join has the program in two files)}${NP_OSD:+ (OSD mode${NP_OSD_STEPS:+, stepping})}${NP_SERVER_BIN:+ (server${NP_MENU:+, room from the menu}${NP_INCORE:+, Join room in the core}${NP_DECOY:+, two rooms}${NP_AUTOJOIN:+, Join same game}${NP_DIRECT:+, direct=$NP_DIRECT}${NP_SAV:+, .sav})}${NP_GBA_RELOAD:+ ($NP_GBA_RELOAD loads the game again)}"
